    "title": "Tucson Motorcyclist, 41, Dies After Running Red Light at Broadway and Campbell - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Devon Baca ,\n4 hours ago N. Campbell Ave. & E. Broadway Blvd. — Site of Fatal Motorcycle Crash. A 41-year-old Tucson motorcyclist died early Saturday after running a red light and colliding with a northbound vehicle at a midtown intersection. Jose Nadir Parra was pronounced dead at the scene of the crash, which happened around 2 a.m. at East Broadway and North Campbell Avenue. Read full article\n8",
